{"id":82,"name":"الإنفطار","transliteration":"Al-Infitar","translation_fr":"La rupture","translation_en":"The Cleaving","type":"meccan","total_verses":19,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنفَطَرَتۡ","translation_fr":"Quand le ciel se rompra","translation_en":"When the sky breaks apart","transliteration":"Itha alssamao infatarat"},{"id":2,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡكَوَاكِبُ ٱنتَثَرَتۡ","translation_fr":"et que les étoiles se disperseront","translation_en":"And when the stars fall, scattering","transliteration":"Waitha alkawakibu intatharat"},{"id":3,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡبِحَارُ فُجِّرَتۡ","translation_fr":"et que les mers confondront leurs eaux","translation_en":"And when the seas are erupted","transliteration":"Waitha albiharu fujjirat"},{"id":4,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡقُبُورُ بُعۡثِرَتۡ","translation_fr":"et que les tombeaux seront bouleversés","translation_en":"And when the [contents of] graves are scattered","transliteration":"Waitha alqubooru buAAthirat"},{"id":5,"text":"عَلِمَتۡ نَفۡسٞ مَّا قَدَّمَتۡ وَأَخَّرَتۡ","translation_fr":"toute âme saura alors ce qu'elle a accompli et ce qu'elle a remis de faire à plus tard","translation_en":"A soul will [then] know what it has put forth and kept back","transliteration":"AAalimat nafsun ma qaddamat waakhkharat"},{"id":6,"text":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مَا غَرَّكَ بِرَبِّكَ ٱلۡكَرِيمِ","translation_fr":"O homme! Qu'est-ce qui t'a trompé au sujet de ton Seigneur, le Noble","translation_en":"O mankind, what has deceived you concerning your Lord, the Generous","transliteration":"Ya ayyuha alinsanu ma gharraka birabbika alkareemi"},{"id":7,"text":"ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَكَ فَسَوَّىٰكَ فَعَدَلَكَ","translation_fr":"qui t'a créé, puis modelé et constitué harmonieusement","translation_en":"Who created you, proportioned you, and balanced you","transliteration":"Allathee khalaqaka fasawwaka faAAadalaka"},{"id":8,"text":"فِيٓ أَيِّ صُورَةٖ مَّا شَآءَ رَكَّبَكَ","translation_fr":"Il t'a façonné dans la forme qu'Il a voulue","translation_en":"In whatever form He willed has He assembled you","transliteration":"Fee ayyi sooratin ma shaa rakkabaka"},{"id":9,"text":"كَلَّا بَلۡ تُكَذِّبُونَ بِٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"Non...! [malgré tout] vous traitez la Rétribution de mensonge","translation_en":"No! But you deny the Recompense","transliteration":"Kalla bal tukaththiboona bialddeeni"},{"id":10,"text":"وَإِنَّ عَلَيۡكُمۡ لَحَٰفِظِينَ","translation_fr":"alors que veillent sur vous des gardiens","translation_en":"And indeed, [appointed] over you are keepers","transliteration":"Wainna AAalaykum lahafitheena"},{"id":11,"text":"كِرَامٗا كَٰتِبِينَ","translation_fr":"de nobles scribes","translation_en":"Noble and recording","transliteration":"Kiraman katibeena"},{"id":12,"text":"يَعۡلَمُونَ مَا تَفۡعَلُونَ","translation_fr":"qui savent ce que vous faites","translation_en":"They know whatever you do","transliteration":"YaAAlamoona ma tafAAaloona"},{"id":13,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡأَبۡرَارَ لَفِي نَعِيمٖ","translation_fr":"Les bons seront, certes, dans un [jardin] de délice","translation_en":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure","transliteration":"Inna alabrara lafee naAAeemin"},{"id":14,"text":"وَإِنَّ ٱلۡفُجَّارَ لَفِي جَحِيمٖ","translation_fr":"et les libertins seront, certes, dans une fournaise","translation_en":"And indeed, the wicked will be in Hellfire","transliteration":"Wainna alfujjara lafee jaheemin"},{"id":15,"text":"يَصۡلَوۡنَهَا يَوۡمَ ٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"où ils brûleront, le jour de la Rétribution","translation_en":"They will [enter to] burn therein on the Day of Recompense","transliteration":"Yaslawnaha yawma alddeeni"},{"id":16,"text":"وَمَا هُمۡ عَنۡهَا بِغَآئِبِينَ","translation_fr":"incapables de s'en échapper","translation_en":"And never therefrom will they be absent","transliteration":"Wama hum AAanha bighaibeena"},{"id":17,"text":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا يَوۡمُ ٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"Et qui te dira ce qu'est le jour de la Rétribution","translation_en":"And what can make you know what is the Day of Recompense","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma yawmu alddeeni"},{"id":18,"text":"ثُمَّ مَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا يَوۡمُ ٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"Encore une fois, qui te dira ce qu'est le jour de la Rétribution","translation_en":"Then, what can make you know what is the Day of Recompense","transliteration":"Thumma ma adraka ma yawmu alddeeni"},{"id":19,"text":"يَوۡمَ لَا تَمۡلِكُ نَفۡسٞ لِّنَفۡسٖ شَيۡـٔٗاۖ وَٱلۡأَمۡرُ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلَّهِ","translation_fr":"Le jour où aucune âme ne pourra rien en faveur d'une autre âme. Et ce jour-là, le commandement sera à Allah","translation_en":"It is the Day when a soul will not possess for another soul [power to do] a thing; and the command, that Day, is [entirely] with Allah","transliteration":"Yawma la tamliku nafsun linafsin shayan waalamru yawmaithin lillahi"}]}